    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d524">

                <pb facs="0798" n="765" sameAs="frus:frus1964-68v23/pg765"/>

                <head>524. Memorandum From the President’s Special Assistant (Rostow) to President
                        Johnson<anchor n="1" xml:id="d524-f1"/></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName>Washington</placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1967-07-13T17:30:00-04:00">July 13, 1967,
                            5:30 p.m.</date></dateline></opener>
                <opener>
                    <salute>Mr. President:</salute>
                </opener>
                <p>Attached are the figures you requested on U.S. economic and military assistance
                    to the Congo:</p>
                <pb facs="0799" n="766" xml:id="pg766"/>
                <p>—At <hi rendition="#italic">Tab A</hi> is a breakdown of economic assistance
                    since the Congo became independent, arranged by category of economic aid.<anchor
                        n="2" xml:id="d524-f2"/></p>
                <p>—At <hi rendition="#italic">Tab B</hi> is a breakdown of military aid.</p>
                <p>—At <hi rendition="#italic">Tab C</hi> is a summary of aid to the Congo from
                    other nations.</p>
                <p>The grand totals are as follows:</p>
                <p>—U.S. economic and military assistance from FY 1960 to FY 1967: $543 million.</p>
                <p>—Of this total, $349 million is economic and $194 million is military.</p>
                <p>—Another $44 million in U.S. aid is planned for FY 1968.</p>
                <p>—We have good figures for other donors only through FY 1966. As of the end of
                    that year, other nations—bilaterally and through the U.N.—contributed a total of
                    $574 million.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>W.W. Rostow<anchor n="3" xml:id="d524-f3"/></signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
